<p><a href="/name/Peggy/">Peggy</a> is further along: 162,120 living, median age 72, and 96.1 percent of them over fifty. 12 Peggys were born in 2025.</p>
<p><a href="/name/Vicki/">Vicki</a> is the end of the line. 118,412 living Vickis, median age 68, and a blank space where 2025 should be. The Social Security Administration publishes a name only in the years at least five babies get it. Fewer than five did.</p>
<p>Across all 34 names, 45,108 babies got these names in the last ten years. In their peak years, those same names produced 858,925.</p>
