<h2>One name that is coming back</h2>
<p><a href="/name/Dorothy/">Dorothy</a> is the exception. It peaked in 1924, went quiet, and then returned: 743 Dorothys in 2025, the only name on the list above five hundred. Its living population — 244,545 people, median age 77 — is still old.</p>
<p>That is how revivals work. The babies come back before the population does.</p>
