<h2>The other end of the same dataset</h2>
<p><a href="/name/Linda/">Linda</a> and <a href="/name/Mateo/">Mateo</a> are both names with more than a hundred thousand living Americans, and nothing else in common. Linda has 1,010,533 of them, at a median age of 72. Mateo has 125,137, at a median age of 7.</p>
<p>Mateo peaked in 2024 with 11,349 boys, and 11,045 boys got the name last year. Susan peaked in 1955, with 47,418 girls.</p>
